(1) v + 1.5 = [0#3][ 2.5 3.5 4.5 ]
(2) m + 1.5 = [0#2,0#2]
[ 2.5 3.5
  4.5 5.5 ]
(3) t + 1.5 = [0#2,0#2,0#2]
[ 1.5 3.5
  5.5 7.5 ;;
  2.5 4.5
  6.5 8.5 ]
(4) k + 1 (ZZ32, beside the library's own) = [0#3][ 2 3 4 ]
(5) v ⊙ v = [0#3][ 1.0 4.0 9.0 ]   t ⊙ t = [0#2,0#2,0#2]
[ 0.0 4.0
  16.0 36.0 ;;
  1.0 9.0
  25.0 49.0 ]   k ⊙ k = [0#3][ 1 4 9 ]
(6) v + 1 (integer literal into a T = RR64 slot) = [0#3][ 2.0 3.0 4.0 ]
exit 0  (3 s)
